              "activity": "Operation “Roma225”\nThe Cybaze-Yoroi ZLab researchers investigated a recent espionage malware implant weaponized to target companies in the Italian automotive sector. The malware was spread through well written phishing email trying to impersonate a senior partner of one of the major Brazilian business law firms: “Veirano Advogados”.\nhttps://yoroi.company/research/the-enigmatic-roma225-campaign/"
